# .fix-issue-ignore
#
# Paths the fix-issue agent must NEVER touch in this repo.
# Uses .gitignore-style glob patterns (via Python fnmatch).
# Check this file into version control — it's visible to anyone reviewing agent PRs.
#
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Examples — uncomment and adapt:
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------

# Security-sensitive paths
# auth/**
# oauth/**
# **/tokens.py

# Payment processing
# payments/**
# billing/**
# stripe/**

# Database migrations (auto-generated — never hand-edit)
# **/migrations/**
# **/alembic/**

# CI/CD configuration
# .github/workflows/**
# .circleci/**
# Jenkinsfile

# Dependency lock files
# poetry.lock
# package-lock.json
# Pipfile.lock

# Compiled / generated output
# dist/**
# build/**
# *.min.js
